    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/2.11.0"&gt;2.11.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/StackExchange.Redis/2.11.0" rel="nofollow"&gt;get 2.11.0 on NuGet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;For &lt;a href="https://redis.io/blog/announcing-redis-86-performance-improvements-streams/" rel="nofollow"&gt;Redis 8.6&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(&lt;a href="https://stackexchange.github.io/StackExchange.Redis/Streams#idempotent-write-at-most-once-production" rel="nofollow"&gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;) Add support for idempotent streams by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3907365075" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3006" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3006/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3006"&gt;#3006&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(&lt;a href="https://stackexchange.github.io/StackExchange.Redis/HotKeys" rel="nofollow"&gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;) Add support for &lt;code&gt;HOTKEYS&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3910697228" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3008" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3008/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3008"&gt;#3008&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(&lt;a href="https://stackexchange.github.io/StackExchange.Redis/Authentication#user-certificates-with-implicit-user-authentication" rel="nofollow"&gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;) Add documentation for client certificate authentication by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3919931462" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3009" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3009/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3009"&gt;#3009&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The time-series changes for 8.6 are over in &lt;a href="https://github.com/redis/NRedisStack/releases/tag/v1.3.0"&gt;NRedisStack 1.3.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other features:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(&lt;a href="https://stackexchange.github.io/StackExchange.Redis/KeyspaceNotifications" rel="nofollow"&gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;) Add support for keyspace notifications including cluster support by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3843310986" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2995" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2995/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2995"&gt;#2995&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update README to include Azure Managed Redis by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/redis-phil/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/redis-phil"&gt;@redis-phil&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3898046913" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3005" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3005/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3005"&gt;#3005&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Internal bits:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Options: Split out AMR to its own options provider by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/NickCraver/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/NickCraver"&gt;@NickCraver&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3711738794" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2986" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2986/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2986"&gt;#2986&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update CI to 8.6 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3925506378" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3010" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3010/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3010"&gt;#3010&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/redis-phil/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/redis-phil"&gt;@redis-phil&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3898046913" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3005" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3005/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3005"&gt;#3005&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/compare/2.10.14...2.11.0"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;2.10.14...2.11.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
